WEBVTT

00:00:09,520 --> 00:00:12,960
Is there a time that you no longer load questions for zoom calls?

00:00:12,960 --> 00:00:17,040
Is there a way to tell if a question that was submitted was uploaded by you?

00:00:18,720 --> 00:00:27,240
Well, if you ask the question on the site, and I don't have an answer that you know you didn't get on here.

00:00:27,240 --> 00:00:34,520
So I asked that you try to get your questions in, you know, half hour before the zoom call.

00:00:34,520 --> 00:00:37,560
That's just my request for you.

00:00:37,560 --> 00:00:42,480
But this question came in two minutes before the zoom call.

00:00:42,480 --> 00:00:44,840
So I just saw it and put it out here.

00:00:44,840 --> 00:00:53,240
So yes, I'll try to get questions in as best I possibly can up to, you know, right when we do the zoom call.

00:00:53,240 --> 00:00:55,800
But sometimes that's not possible.

00:00:55,800 --> 00:01:03,560
So if you ask a question and it doesn't get on here, it just you try to get it in a little earlier next time.

00:01:03,560 --> 00:01:06,200
So they let it get on here.

00:01:06,200 --> 00:01:07,880
It'll be on the next one.

00:01:07,880 --> 00:01:18,760
So if I didn't put your question on the zoom call, it will be on the next zoom call unless it's a question that you've asked multiple times.

00:01:18,760 --> 00:01:25,040
We've had that happen where a person has asked the exact same question multiple times that they didn't look at them.

00:01:25,040 --> 00:01:32,680
I answered it at last zoom call and they asked it again, you know, and because they didn't listen to the last zoom call.

00:01:32,680 --> 00:01:34,680
They weren't able to get on, but they didn't listen to it.

00:01:34,680 --> 00:01:43,000
So I didn't necessarily put that on again because all the people that have jumped on and listened to it or regular people are, they'd be like, you answer that.

00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:44,960
I think you answered this last week.

00:01:44,960 --> 00:01:50,850
So I don't do that if it's a duplicate question.

00:01:50,850 --> 00:01:59,770
But if you ask a question, if you posted a question and it didn't get on that week, zoom call, it would be on the next week.

